# TNA Form 01 layout (Annex 1-1)

Source of truth: `TNA FORM 01.docx` — SETUP Guidelines (Revision 3.0) Annex 1-1.
Do not keep Annex B-11, ₱1.5M capital bands, Republic/DOST logo header, or GAD on the official print.

## Document title

`DOST TNA FORM 01 - Application for Technology Needs Assessment`

Mixed case. Do **not** force uppercase via CSS.

## Page

- A4 portrait. Margins: top 21.5mm, right 10.6mm, bottom 20.5mm, left 20.1mm (Word `pgMar`).
- Body: Arial ~11.5pt. Headings black (no DOST-blue bars on print).
- `@page tna-form-01-sheet` footer:

`SETUP Guidelines (Revision 3.0) Annex 1-1: DOST TNA FORM 01 - Application for Technology Needs Assessment Page ` + `counter(page)` / `counter(pages)`

No inline per-section footers. Live print uses CSS counters (Word hard-codes ~12 sheets).

## Pagination

- Section titles stay with content (`break-inside: avoid` on `.tna-form-block`).
- Do **not** force one section per physical page.
- Never use `break-before: always` on sections.

## Official print vs portal

- Print is `TnaForm01Document` via `createRoot` (`printTnaForm01Pdf`). Do **not** clone the preview DOM.
- No logo / Republic header on print or official preview document.
- GAD stays in the wizard only — omit from `TnaForm01Document`.
- Type of Organization includes **LGU**; capital labels are P3M / P15M / P100M (Word `image2.png`).
- Employee grid matches Word `image4.png`: Direct M/F, Production M/F, Non-production Senior Citizen / PWD, Indirect/Contract M/F, Total M/F.
- Validated by: `PSTD/CASTD/CSTD`.

## Print path

In-page `window.print()` to `#tna-form-01-print-root`. Do not use popup `document.write`.

